        "id": "CaitlynPassive",
        "name": "Headshot",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Every few basic attacks, or against a target she has trapped or netted, Caitlyn will fire a headshot dealing bonus damage that scales with her critical strike chance. On trapped or netted targets, Caitlyn's Headshot attack range is doubled.",
        "bodyHtml": "Every 5 Attacks, Caitlyn fires a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Headshot</span>. Attacks while in brush count as for building towards a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Headshot</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Headshots</span> deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span>. They have double range against enemies affected by <span></span> and <span></span>. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Headshots</span> against enemies hit by <span></span> deal a further <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span>.",
