        "name": "Yordle Snap Trap",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Caitlyn sets a trap that, when sprung, reveals and immobilizes the enemy champion for 1.5 seconds, granting Caitlyn an empowered Headshot.",
        "bodyHtml": "Caitlyn sets a trap that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Roots</span> the first champion that steps on it for 1.5 seconds and granting <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">True Sight</span> of them for 3 seconds. Traps last for 30/35/40/45/50 seconds, and 3/3/4/4/5 traps may be active at once. This Ability has 3/3/4/4/5 charges (26/22/18/14/10 second refresh).<br /><br />Targets rooted by this Ability take an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(35/80/125/170/215 + (30% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> from <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Headshot</span>.",
